note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
fn arslot q edit ulong 8 r edit ulong 3 st edit ulong 7 to long
rec = new ulong 16 0
put rec 0 and get r 0 4294967295
put rec 1 shr get r 0 32
put rec 2 get r 1
put rec 3 get r 2
put rec 4 get q 0
put rec 5 get q 1
if ne get q 2 0
put rec 6 1
end
for i ulong 6
put rec add i 8 get st i
end
put rec 14 and get st 6 4294967295
put rec 15 shr get st 6 32
rc = apishl get q 3 get q 4 rec
put r 0 or ulong uint and get rec 0 4294967295 shl ulong uint and get rec 1 4294967295 32
put r 1 get rec 2
put r 2 get rec 3
put q 0 get rec 4
for i ulong 6
put st i get rec add i 8
end
put st 6 or ulong uint and get rec 14 4294967295 shl ulong uint and get rec 15 4294967295 32
ret rc
end
